{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "librarian-map-add_project-0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 80,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 260,
      "text": "### frame\n_Which project is this for, what stage is it at, and what is fixed?_\n\n**To leave:**\n- no Project note for 'P': create_project\n\n**Gate uses:** `create_project`, `update_plan`\n\n**Tools:** `create_project`, `get_note`, `search`, `session_status`, `topics_list`, `update_plan`"
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-map-add_project-1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 380,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 260,
      "text": "### ingest\n_What does the person already have (repositories, papers, notes) that belongs in the library?_\n\n**To leave:**\n- record what the person already has: update_plan(fields={'ingested': ...}) (a list, or 'none')\n\n**Gate uses:** `update_plan`\n\n**Tools:** `get_note`, `ingest`, `queue_source`, `search`, `update_plan`"
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-map-add_project-2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 680,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 260,
      "text": "### map\n_What does the library already hold on this, and under which topics?_\n\n**To leave:**\n- record the orientation: search with intent 'orient', then update_plan(fields={'map': ...})\n\n**Gate uses:** `search`, `update_plan`\n\n**Tools:** `dispatch_plan`, `get_note`, `read_source_file`, `record_assumptions`, `request_raw_source_access`, `search`, `source_verification_plan`, `update_plan`"
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-map-add_project-3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 980,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 260,
      "text": "### need\n_What is needed, and what must a candidate not assume, require or depend on?_\n\n**To leave:**\n- open at least one brief: open_brief(need, disqualifiers)\n\n**Gate uses:** `open_brief`\n\n**Tools:** `get_note`, `open_brief`, `read_source_file`, `record_assumptions`, `search`, `update_plan`"
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-map-add_project-4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 1280,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 260,
      "text": "### search\n_What did the last round teach? Which 2-4 sub-threads are open, and what is the next named target?_\n\n**To leave:**\n- run rounds until the stopping rule fires: research_round, then checkpoint\n\n**Gate uses:** `checkpoint`, `research_round`\n\n**Tools:** `checkpoint`, `get_note`, `ingest`, `queue_source`, `read_source_file`, `research_round`, `search`, `web_search`"
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-map-add_project-5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 1580,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 260,
      "text": "### judge\n_What role would each candidate play? A rejection needs its reason._\n\n**To leave:**\n- before committing: record what you are assuming and how each was settled - record_assumptions([{assumption, settled_by, how}]), where settled_by is a tool you called here, an answered question's id, or 'unverifiable' (an empty list if you assume nothing)\n\n**Gate uses:** `decide`, `session_status`\n\n**Tools:** `add_candidate`, `decide`, `get_note`, `record_assumptions`, `search`, `session_status`, `staging_list`, `staging_review`, `staging_show`"
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-map-add_project-6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 1880,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 260,
      "text": "### synthesise\n_Which sources together; at what cost; what is unknown; what to open first? Every claim carries its source and a verbatim quote._\n\n**To leave:**\n- record the cross-source synthesis: record_synthesis\n\n**Gate uses:** `draft_offering`, `promote_offering`, `record_synthesis`\n\n**Tools:** `draft_offering`, `get_note`, `promote_offering`, `record_synthesis`, `record_trace`, `search`"
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-map-add_project-7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 2180,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 260,
      "text": "### check_out\n_What did the library fail to answer?_\n\n**To leave:**\n- nothing: advance\n\n**Gate uses:** `close_brief`\n\n**Tools:** `close_brief`, `close_session`, `get_note`, `record_application`, `staging_list`, `update_plan`"
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-map-add_project",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 2480,
      "label": "add_project session"
    },
    {
